  description: "[ Pendulum Effect ] \nIf you have a card in your other Pendulum Zone:
    You can activate 1 of these effects;\r\n\u25CF Special Summon this card.\r\n\u25CF
    Destroy this card, and if you do, Special Summon 1 Level 5 or lower Pendulum
    Monster Card from your Pendulum Zone.\r\nYou can only use this effect of \"Wind
    Unicorn Parallel, the Dracoslayer\" once per turn.\n\n[ Monster Effect ] \nWhile
    this Pendulum Summoned card is in your Monster Zone, your opponent cannot target
    it with card effects, also it cannot be destroyed by your opponent's card effects.
    (Quick Effect): You can target 1 Pendulum Monster Card you control and 1 card
    your opponent controls; return them to the hand. You can only use this effect
    of \"Wind Unicorn Parallel, the Dracoslayer\" once per turn."
